      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. Hashing algorithms\n    - MD5 , SHA1\n    - Encrypt the longURL using md5, sha1-> {shortURL: first(6 or 7)} -> store in DB -> 201 created response\n    - but, first 6,7 chars can be duplicate\n\n3. Generate ID using base62",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2. Hashing algorithms\n    - MD5 , SHA1\n    - Encrypt the longURL using md5, sha1-> {shortURL: first(6 or 7)} -> store in DB -> 201 created response\n    - but, first 6,7 chars can be duplicate\n\n3. Generate ID using base62",
